<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahrend plans to buy Baum in Berlin.</title>
<headline>Ahrend plans to buy Baum in Berlin.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office equipment group Ahrend NV said on Wednesday it was planning to take over Baum in Berlin.</p>
<p>Ahrend said the acquisition was likely to be completed this year and would contribute to profits in 1997.  </p>
<p>Office supplier Papier Baum has annual turnover of 15 million guilders.</p>
